{"char_end":239,"char_start":32,"chunk_id":"chk_afa5235a46f5","doc_id":"doc_74919c5bf3a7","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"护 。","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_afa5235a46f5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10619191051905236},{"anchor_text":"设 备","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_afa5235a46f5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10619191051905236},{"anchor_text":"机 组","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_afa5235a46f5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10619191051905236},{"anchor_text":"温 保","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_afa5235a46f5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10619191051905236},{"anchor_text":"过 温","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_afa5235a46f5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10167138137704386}],"chunking":"heading_window"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","text":"智联 TCU-900 温控机组用于精密产线的循环冷却与过温保护。机组由冷媒回路、循环水泵、控制主板与远程告警模块组成。额定冷却能力为 9.0 kW，工作电源为三相 AC 380 V / 50 Hz。出厂默认将过温保护阈值设置为 65℃，用户可在 45℃ 至 80℃ 之间调整。\n\n本手册覆盖启动前检查、日常运行、过温告警处理与月度维护。操作人员须持有设备主管部门颁发的特种设备作业证，且在近 12 个月内完成复训。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","1. 产品概述"],"token_count":155}
{"char_end":486,"char_start":267,"chunk_id":"chk_4b1f50f2406f","doc_id":"doc_74919c5bf3a7","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"水 温","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4b1f50f2406f","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.15064935045118064},{"anchor_text":"温 度","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4b1f50f2406f","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.11877367827310109},{"anchor_text":"出 水","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4b1f50f2406f","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.1004329003007871},{"anchor_text":"型 号","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4b1f50f2406f","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.1004329003007871},{"anchor_text":"- 04","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4b1f50f2406f","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.1004329003007871}],"chunking":"heading_window"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","text":"控制主板型号为 CMC-12B，负责采集出水温度、回水温度与压缩机电流。远程告警模块型号为 ALM-04，通过 RS-485 接入厂级监控，波特率固定为 9600。循环水泵额定流量 4.5 m³/h，扬程 18 m。冷媒回路使用 R134a，禁止混用其他工质。\n\n当控制主板检测到出水温度连续 8 秒高于保护阈值，会向 ALM-04 发送过温告警帧，同时切断压缩机接触器 KM1。切断后水泵继续运行不少于 120 秒，以便带走换热器余热。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","2. 系统架构","2.1 模块划分"],"token_count":153}
{"char_end":590,"char_start":502,"chunk_id":"chk_4a35c47af89e","doc_id":"doc_74919c5bf3a7","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"表 示","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4a35c47af89e","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.2119350920490734},{"anchor_text":"色 常","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4a35c47af89e","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.14129006136604894},{"anchor_text":"常 亮","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4a35c47af89e","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.14129006136604894},{"anchor_text":"亮 表","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4a35c47af89e","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.14129006136604894},{"anchor_text":"故 障","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_4a35c47af89e","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.14129006136604894}],"chunking":"heading_window"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","text":"面板设有运行、告警、故障三色指示灯。绿色常亮表示正常制冷；黄色闪烁表示过温告警尚未复位；红色常亮表示硬件故障，必须停机检修。人机界面禁止在压缩机启动后 30 秒内修改保护阈值。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","2. 系统架构","2.2 人机界面"],"token_count":77}
{"char_end":786,"char_start":605,"chunk_id":"chk_b2ba12331fe5","doc_id":"doc_74919c5bf3a7","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"检 查","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_b2ba12331fe5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.12802741477530488},{"anchor_text":"确 认","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_b2ba12331fe5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10825769455695744},{"anchor_text":"环 境","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_b2ba12331fe5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10825769455695744},{"anchor_text":". 确","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_b2ba12331fe5","position_in_chunk":17,"score":0.10825769455695744},{"anchor_text":"低 于","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_b2ba12331fe5","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10825769455695744}],"chunking":"heading_window"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","text":"每次启动前必须完成下列检查：\n\n1. 确认冷却塔补水阀处于开启状态，水箱液位不低于最低刻度线。\n2. 检查散热通道无堵塞，过滤网压差不超过 150 Pa。\n3. 确认急停按钮已复位，KM1 与 KM2 触点无粘连。\n4. 记录环境温度。若环境温度低于 5℃，应先启用曲轴箱加热 15 分钟。\n\n未完成启动前检查不得合闸。违反该规程导致的压缩机液击不在质保范围内。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","3. 启动前检查"],"token_count":137}
